# SmartBear Software
> Software testing, monitoring, and API lifecycle management tools for teams of all sizes
## What we do
SmartBear is a leading provider of software quality and visibility solutions, empowering development teams to deliver exceptional software faster. Founded in 2003, we've grown to serve over 16 million developers, testers, and software engineers at 32,000+ organizations across 194 countries. Our comprehensive platform approach integrates testing, monitoring, and API development tools to help teams build, test, and monitor software applications throughout the entire development lifecycle.
Our mission is to be the first choice for software development teams of all sizes, providing tools that immediately impact the delivery of tomorrow's applications. With approximately 960 employees globally and offices in the US, Ireland, UK, Poland, India, Finland, Sweden, and Australia, we combine global reach with local expertise to support our customers' success.
