## Open source products
SmartBear actively maintains and contributes to several foundational open source projects that have become industry standards:
- **Swagger**: API design and documentation tools that enable teams to design, build, and document APIs collaboratively.
- URL: [Swagger](https://swagger.io/)
- **Pact**: Contract testing framework enabling consumer-driven contract testing between microservices
- URL: [Pact](https://pact.io/)
- **Stoplight**: Open source API design, documentation, and governance tools that complement our commercial offerings
- URL: [Stoplight](https://stoplight.io/)
- **SoapUI**: Open source API testing tool that has been widely adopted for functional and security testing of SOAP and REST APIs
- URL: [SoapUI](https://soapui.org/)
